## The tunnels under the cave mouth, down to the bog and the ramp.

## Room 10. LOOK.BAS 1000 and 1050.

create the Observation Platform
  a room
  room name:
    Observation platform
  exits, one-way: down to the Stair Room

  You are standing on an observation platform overlooking a{br}
  forest with both a lake and a building.

