## Room 15. LOOK.BAS 1500 and 1550.

create the Tunnel
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    Tunnel
  exits, one-way: north to the Junction of Tunnels, south to the Cave Enterance, up to the Cave Enterance, down to the Junction of Tunnels, in to the Junction of Tunnels, out to the Cave Enterance

  You are in a dark north-south tunnel.

## Room 16. LOOK.BAS 1600 and 1650.

create the Junction of Tunnels
  a room, dark while not lit-up
