## Room 18. LOOK.BAS 1800 and 1850.

create the Top of Ramp
  a room, dark while not lit-up
  room name:
    Top of ramp.
  exits, one-way: north to the Light Room, east to the Diagonal Passage, south to the Edge of Bog, southeast to the North of Door, southwest to the Cave Exit, down to the Cave Exit, out to the Cave Exit

  You are in a room at the top of a long, steep ramp.{br}
  Passages lead north,south,east, and SE.

